Parts of cbits/aes/gcm_fused_x86.c follow the AES-GCM implementation in
picotls, lib/fusion.c, which is under the MIT license reproduced below.
The design is described by its author at

    http://blog.kazuhooku.com/2020/06/quicaes-gcm-12.html
    http://blog.kazuhooku.com/2020/06/quicaes-gcm-22.html

and the source is at https://github.com/h2o/picotls.


